  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">English Language Training for Officials: International Security Trends (Intake 54)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to develop the English language capabilities of Officials from Cambodia, Indonesia, Lao PDR, Viet Nam and Timor-Leste. It is themed around International Security Trends and combines a 13 week online programme, a workplace project, and a 3 week symposium in New Zealand to cement language skills and relationships.</narrative>
  </description>
